PRETABLE -- #538, the LANE-class closure of #530's width row (regress/lca_widewrite_probe.py).  Written 2026-09-18
BEFORE any leg of this table runs; this file's mtime is the order proof.  The instrument is the four-cell probe built
per fable5's #530 §F2 ruling (R1/R2), frozen beside this file before the first leg.

THE CELLS (replayed offline from the probe's own sim_store_buf; each is ONE 16-byte chunk at k = 0):
    wide   port 0x2ff  lane 3  ns16550 SCR   preset 0x5a -> WANT 0x44 ('D' = s[3])
    l0w16  port 0x2fc  lane 0  ns16550 MCR   preset 0x03 -> WANT 0x41 ('A' = s[0])
    low16  port 0x021  lane 1  8259 IMR      preset 0xff -> WANT 0x42 ('B' = s[1])
    l2w16  port 0x2fe  lane 2  ns16550 MSR   preset 0xb0 -> WANT 0xf3 ('C' = s[2], read back OR 0xb0)
Rows per cell: <cell> alive, <cell> live, <cell> getenv; plus `row count'.  13 rows.  Base must be 13/13.

================================================================ PREDICTIONS (score; which getenv rows red)
